sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Land Owner
    participant Portal as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Chain as LandRegistry.sol
    actor Registrar as Sub-Registrar

    Owner->>Portal: Connect MetaMask Wallet & Sign Nonce
    Portal->>API: POST /api/wallet/link
    API-->>Portal: Wallet Linked & Verified

    Owner->>Portal: Enter Cadastral Data & Upload Title Deed
    Portal->>Portal: Compute Client-Side SHA-256 Hash
    Portal->>API: POST /api/lands & POST /api/documents/upload
    API->>DB: Insert Land (PENDING_VERIFICATION) & LandDocument
    API-->>Portal: Application Created

    Registrar->>Portal: Inspect Application & Title Documents
    Registrar->>Portal: Test SHA-256 Hash Integrity
    Registrar->>Portal: Click "Approve On-Chain"
    Portal->>API: POST /api/registrations/:id/approve

    API->>DB: Update Land status to BLOCKCHAIN_PENDING
    API->>Chain: registerLand(propertyId, surveyNo, ownerWallet, docHash)
    Chain-->>API: Emit LandRegistered & Return Tx Receipt
    API->>DB: Update Land status to REGISTERED & store Tx Hash
    API->>DB: Record BlockchainTransaction & AuditLog
    API-->>Portal: Registration Confirmed
    Portal-->>Registrar: Show Mining Proof & Tx Hash
